  "_attribution": "Adapted from Hangry Labs VoxCPMTTS for Qwen3-TTS Studio; see NOTICE.",
  "text:Generate speech": "生成语音",
  "text:Design voice": "音色设计",
  "text:Clone voice": "克隆声音",
  "text:Good morning! It is a lovely day to give your ideas a voice.": "早上好！今天真适合让你的创意发声。",
  "text:Welcome to our little corner of the world. Take a breath, settle in, and let the story begin.": "欢迎来到我们的小天地。深呼吸，放松下来，让故事开始吧。",
  "text:This is a new sentence, spoken with the voice from my reference recording.": "这是一句新话，使用参考录音中的声音说出。",
  "text:Reference audio": "参考音频",
  "text:Your voice reference": "你的声音参考",
  "text:Upload, record, or use a designed voice": "上传、录音或使用设计的声音",
  "text:Generated audio": "生成音频",
  "text:Your voice, ready to hear": "声音已准备好，等你聆听",
  "text:Generated speech appears here": "生成的语音将显示在这里",
  "text:Unable to load audio.": "无法加载音频。",
  "text:Microphone ready": "麦克风已就绪",
