  "text:Recorded {time}": "已录制 {time}",
  "text:Recording needs microphone permission and localhost or HTTPS.": "录音需要麦克风权限，并通过 localhost 或 HTTPS 访问。",
  "text:Choose reference audio smaller than 10 MB.": "请选择小于 10 MB 的参考音频。",
  "text:{0} input characters": "输入 {0} 个字符",
  "text:{0} / 1000 characters": "{0} / 1000 个字符",
  "text:Creates a new voice from a description.": "根据描述创建新声音。",
  "text:Recreates a voice from reference audio.": "根据参考音频重现声音。",
  "text:Nine built-in speakers. The 1.7B model also supports style instructions.": "九种内置声音。1.7B 模型还支持风格指令。",
  "text:(optional for speaker identity only)": "（仅说话人特征时可选）",
  "text:Delivery direction is experimental. Choose Speaker and reference transcript for best results; speaker identity only may ignore the direction. Leave blank to clone without direction.": "表达指令为实验功能。建议选择“说话人与参考文本”；仅说话人特征模式可能忽略指令。留空则不指定表达方式。",
  "text:Delivery direction is experimental. The reference audio and its exact transcript help guide the delivery. Results vary by voice and instruction; leave blank to clone without direction.": "表达指令为实验功能。参考音频及其准确文本有助于引导表达。效果因声音和指令而异；留空则不指定表达方式。",
