  "text:Randomize": "随机化种子",
  "text:Unknown input mode.": "未知输入模式。",
  "text:Magic inline controls cannot overlap.": "Magic 行内控制不能重叠。",
  "text:Pronunciation substitutions require spoken text.": "发音替换需要朗读文本。",
  "text:Say-as ranges require an interpretation.": "say-as 范围需要指定解释方式。",
  "text:Magic supports break times written in milliseconds or seconds.": "Magic 支持以毫秒或秒表示的停顿时间。",
  "text:Magic supports pauses between 0 and 10000 milliseconds.": "Magic 支持 0 到 10000 毫秒的停顿。",
  "text:Magic supports only substitution and say-as ranges inside a speech turn.": "Magic 台词内部仅支持替换和 say-as 范围。",
  "text:Magic substitutions require a non-empty alias.": "Magic 替换需要非空别名。",
  "text:Magic say-as ranges require an interpretation.": "Magic 的 say-as 范围需要指定解释方式。",
  "text:Magic supports one language control per turn.": "每条 Magic 台词仅支持一个语言控制。",
  "text:Magic turn language cannot be empty.": "Magic 台词语言不能为空。",
  "text:Magic supports one prosody control per turn.": "每条 Magic 台词仅支持一个韵律控制。",
  "text:Invalid SSML-H: {0}": "无效的 SSML-H：{0}",
  "text:Magic supports one metadata section.": "Magic 仅支持一个元数据部分。",
  "text:Magic take response is incomplete.": "Magic 片段响应不完整。",
