  "text:Magic take response uses an unsupported format.": "Magic 片段响应使用了不支持的格式。",
  "text:Magic take response contains an invalid audio range.": "Magic 片段响应包含无效音频范围。",
  "text:Add at least one speech turn before generating.": "生成前请至少添加一条台词。",
