  "text:Whole text gives the model the full sentence before speech starts. This is separate from streaming playback.": "完整文本模式会在开始发声前向模型提供整句内容。此设置与流式播放相互独立。",
  "text:Audio chunk (codec frames)": "音频片段（编解码帧）",
  "text:Audio chunk frames": "音频片段帧数",
  "text:8 frames ≈ 0.67 seconds of audio. Smaller chunks reduce the wait for first audio.": "8 帧 ≈ 0.67 秒音频。更小的片段能缩短首段音频等待时间。",
