  "text:Default delivery direction": "默认表达指令",
  "text:Speak with warmth and quiet excitement.": "用温暖且带着平静喜悦的语气说话。",
  "text:Native-speaker direction requires 1.7B CustomVoice. Saved voices use Base with experimental delivery direction.": "内置声音的表达指令需要 1.7B CustomVoice。已保存的声音使用 Base，其表达指令为实验功能。",
