  "text:Text or SSML to synthesize": "待合成的文本或 SSML",
  "text:What would you like to hear?": "你想听什么？",
  "text:Preview and save a progressive MP3 stream": "预览并保存渐进式 MP3 音频流",
  "text:Qwen is getting ready": "Qwen 正在准备",
  "text:0 KiB buffered": "已缓冲 0 KiB",
  "text:Generation metrics appear here.": "生成指标将显示在这里。",
  "text:Generation diagnostics": "生成诊断",
  "text:Timing details": "耗时详情",
  "text:Generate speech to see timings.": "生成语音后可查看耗时。",
  "text:Server first audio includes reference preparation and audio decoding after model loading. Model TTFA covers model prefill and token generation when reported by streaming. Playback start is scheduled by the browser; it does not measure speaker hardware latency.": "服务端首段音频耗时包含模型加载后的参考准备与音频解码。模型 TTFA 指流式报告中的预填充和令牌生成耗时。播放开始为浏览器调度时间，不代表扬声器硬件延迟。",
  "text:Use as cloning reference": "用作克隆参考",
  "text:Design a voice": "设计声音",
  "text:Example": "示例",
  "text:Describe a voice, listen to a sample, then use it as a cloning reference.": "描述声音，试听样本，再用作克隆参考。",
  "text:Voice description": "声音描述",
  "text:Sample text": "示例文本",
  "text:Write a short passage that brings out the voice you have in mind.": "写一小段能体现你所设想声音的文字。",
  "text:Clone a voice": "克隆声音",
  "text:Upload or record a permitted reference. A few seconds of clean speech works best.": "上传或录制已获授权的参考音频。几秒钟清晰语音效果最佳。",
  "text:Choose reference audio": "选择参考音频",
  "text:Drop reference audio or choose a file": "拖放参考音频或选择文件",
  "text:WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A or OGG · up to 10 MB": "WAV、MP3、FLAC、M4A 或 OGG · 最大 10 MB",
  "text:Microphone": "麦克风",
  "text:Refresh microphones": "刷新麦克风",
  "text:Device names become available after microphone permission.": "允许麦克风权限后可显示设备名称。",
  "text:Microphone waveform": "麦克风波形",
  "text:Clone method": "克隆方式",
  "text:Speaker and reference transcript": "说话人与参考文本",
  "text:Speaker identity only": "仅说话人特征",
  "text:Reference transcript": "参考转写文本",
  "text:(required)": "（必填）",
  "text:The exact words spoken in the reference recording.": "参考录音中说出的准确内容。",
  "text:New text to speak": "要朗读的新文本",
  "text:The words you want the cloned voice to say.": "你希望克隆声音说出的内容。",
  "text:Delivery direction": "表达指令",
  "text:(optional)": "（可选）",
  "text:For example: Speak slowly and gently, with a reassuring tone.": "例如：用安抚的语气，缓慢而温柔地说话。",
  "text:Save this reference": "保存此参考",
  "text:Browse saved voices": "浏览已保存的声音",
  "text:Only clone speakers who have authorized it. Do not use cloned voices for deceptive impersonation.": "仅克隆已获本人授权的声音。不要用克隆声音进行欺骗性冒充。",
  "text:Voice library": "声音库",
  "text:Refresh": "刷新",
  "text:Saved references, portraits and creation settings remain in your local product volume. Use a voice for speech, or refine its original creation settings.": "已保存的参考、头像与创建设置保存在本地产品卷中。可使用声音生成语音，或恢复原始设置进行调整。",
  "text:Search voices, descriptions, languages and tags": "搜索声音、描述、语言和标签",
  "text:Search voices, languages or tags": "搜索声音、语言或标签",
  "text:Studio API": "Studio API",
  "text:The browser and API use the same serialized inference engine.": "浏览器与 API 使用同一串行推理引擎。",
  "text:Use OpenAI-compatible speech clients, native JSON for text/SSML/SSML-H, or the existing multipart Studio routes. All share one Qwen inference queue.": "可使用 OpenAI 兼容语音客户端、文本/SSML/SSML-H 的原生 JSON，或 Studio multipart 路由。所有请求共享一个 Qwen 推理队列。",
  "text:OpenAPI schema": "OpenAPI 架构",
  "text:Speech and dialogue API": "语音与对话 API",
  "text:Actual Qwen checkpoints, native speakers, compatibility aliases and saved voices.": "实际 Qwen 检查点、内置说话人、兼容别名及已保存的声音。",
  "text:OpenAI-compatible plain-text speech; MP3, WAV, FLAC, Opus, AAC, Ogg and raw PCM. Saved voices accept delivery instructions.": "OpenAI 兼容纯文本语音，支持 MP3、WAV、FLAC、Opus、AAC、Ogg 和原始 PCM。已保存的声音支持表达指令。",
  "text:Complete audio, progressive audio or native SSE. Explicit text, SSML and SSML-H input modes.": "完整音频、渐进音频或原生 SSE。显式支持文本、SSML 和 SSML-H 输入模式。",
  "text:Validate and inspect the full synthesis plan before loading a model.": "加载模型前验证并检查完整合成计划。",
  "text:Exact bounded SSML and SSML-H subset, descriptors and limits.": "精确的 SSML 与 SSML-H 子集、描述与限制。",
  "text:Preview/regenerate turns, reuse locked takes and assemble dialogue.": "预览或重新生成台词，复用锁定片段并合成对话。",
  "text:Save, edit and use audio-backed voice references.": "保存、编辑并使用带音频的声音参考。",
  "text:Scripts, folders, settings, takes and explicitly saved audio.": "脚本、文件夹、设置、片段及明确保存的音频。",
  "text:Configured external ASR and bounded FFmpeg audio effects.": "配置的外部 ASR 与受限 FFmpeg 音频效果。",
  "text:Unload this Studio's model and inspect NVIDIA telemetry.": "卸载 Studio 模型并查看 NVIDIA 遥测。",
  "text:API contract and examples": "API 契约与示例",
  "text:Model residency": "模型驻留",
  "text:Keep selected weights in GPU memory": "将所选权重保留在 GPU 显存中",
  "text:Choose the default for each workflow. Kept models load at startup and stay ready together. Other models unload after the complete request. Voice Design is available at 1.7B only.": "为每项工作流选择默认模型。保留的模型在启动时加载并共同保持就绪；其他模型在完整请求后卸载。声音设计仅有 1.7B 版本。",
  "text:Apply model defaults": "应用模型默认设置",
  "text:Manual model controls": "手动模型控制",
  "text:Model to load": "要加载的模型",
  "text:Unload all models": "卸载所有模型",
  "text:Unloading releases memory now. Kept models load again when used or when you apply defaults.": "卸载会立即释放显存。保留的模型将在下次使用或应用默认设置时重新加载。",
  "text:No model loaded": "未加载模型",
  "text:Reference transcription": "参考音频转写",
  "text:Connect an OpenAI-compatible Qwen3 ASR service. Audio stays on the service you choose.": "连接 OpenAI 兼容的 Qwen3 ASR 服务。音频由你选择的服务处理。",
  "text:ASR service URL": "ASR 服务 URL",
  "text:Save connection": "保存连接",
  "text:Test connection": "测试连接",
  "text:Connection not checked": "尚未检查连接",
  "text:MCP access": "MCP 访问",
  "text:Connect an agent to the same speech engine. Compact access offers speech and discovery; advanced access also offers design, reference inputs and voice-library changes. Both are off by default.": "将代理连接到同一语音引擎。精简访问提供语音和发现功能；高级访问还支持设计、参考输入与声音库修改。两者默认均关闭。",
  "text:Compact MCP": "精简 MCP",
  "text:Advanced MCP": "高级 MCP",
  "text:Compact endpoint": "精简端点",
  "text:Advanced endpoint": "高级端点",
  "text:Audio download origin": "音频下载源地址",
  "text:Speech tools return expiring audio links. For clients on another machine, configure the deployment's download origin to a reachable address. The API bearer key also protects MCP when configured.": "语音工具返回有时效的音频链接。其他机器上的客户端需要配置可访问的下载源地址。配置 API bearer 密钥后，MCP 也受其保护。",
  "text:Save MCP access": "保存 MCP 访问设置",
  "text:Your workspace": "你的工作区",
  "text:Generated browser audio stays in this page. MCP speech is stored temporarily until its link expires. Voice references are saved to the product volume when you explicitly save them. Prepared references are reused in memory until you unload the model. Models and compiler caches persist in the product volume.": "浏览器生成的音频留在当前页面。MCP 语音临时保存至链接过期。声音参考仅在你明确保存时写入产品卷。准备好的参考会在内存中复用，直至卸载模型。模型和编译缓存保存在产品卷中。",
  "text:Close dialog": "关闭对话框",
  "text:Store the selected reference, original recording and creation settings in your local library.": "将所选参考、原始录音和创建设置保存到本地声音库。",
  "text:Voice name": "声音名称",
  "text:Cloning reference": "克隆参考",
  "text:Original recording": "原始录音",
  "text:Processed recording": "处理后的录音",
  "text:Description": "描述",
  "text:Tags": "标签",
  "text:(comma separated)": "（逗号分隔）",
  "text:narrator, warm, character": "旁白, 温暖, 角色",
  "text:Voice portrait preview": "声音头像预览",
  "text:Portrait": "头像",
  "text:(PNG, JPEG or WebP, up to 5 MB)": "（PNG、JPEG 或 WebP，最大 5 MB）",
  "text:Remove existing portrait": "移除现有头像",
  "text:Replace the voice being refined with this new recording": "用此新录音替换正在调整的声音",
  "text:0 of 12 characters": "0 / 12 个角色",
  "text:Saved voice tags": "已保存声音的标签",
  "text:(promotion only)": "（仅保存到声音库时）",
  "text:character, narrator": "角色, 旁白",
  "text:Saved voice portrait": "已保存声音的头像",
  "text:SSML and SSML-H": "SSML 与 SSML-H",
  "text:Close guide": "关闭指南",
  "text:Use a speak root. Supported: voice, lang, prosody, break, p, s, sub and bounded say-as. SSML-H adds designed characters and h:direction delivery instructions. Phonemes, remote audio and external lexicons are unsupported.": "使用 speak 根元素。支持 voice、lang、prosody、break、p、s、sub 及受限 say-as。SSML-H 增加设计角色和 h:direction 表达指令。不支持音素、远程音频与外部词典。",
  "text:Rate, pitch and volume are audio effects. Explicit pauses replace the 120 ms turn gap, including 0ms.": "语速、音高和音量属于音频效果。显式停顿会替换台词间的 120 毫秒间隔，包含 0 毫秒。",
  "text:Exact capabilities and limits": "准确功能与限制",
  "text:Audio frames: {0} ≈ {1} seconds. Smaller chunks reduce the wait for first audio.": "音频帧数：{0} ≈ {1} 秒。更小的片段能缩短首段音频等待时间。",
  "text:Waiting for inference. Requests ahead: {0}": "等待推理。前方请求数：{0}",
  "text:Model generation (streaming)": "模型生成（流式）",
  "text:Automatic": "自动",
  "text:Unable to change interface language. Check the connection and try again.": "无法更改界面语言。请检查连接后重试。",
  "text:Raw PCM is 24 kHz mono signed 16-bit little endian. Browser streaming uses MP3. Built-in delivery direction requires 1.7B CustomVoice; Base direction is experimental. SSML audio and phonemes are unsupported. ASR runs externally.": "原始 PCM 为 24 kHz 单声道、有符号 16 位小端格式。浏览器流式播放使用 MP3。内置声音指令需要 1.7B CustomVoice；Base 指令为实验功能。不支持 SSML 音频与音素。ASR 在外部服务运行。",
  "text:Magic does not support nested content inside <{0}>.": "Magic 不支持 <{0}> 内的嵌套内容。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit <{0}> inside a speech turn.": "Magic 无法编辑台词内部的 <{0}>。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit the <{0}> metadata element.": "Magic 无法编辑元数据元素 <{0}>。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit the <{0}> SSML-H extension.": "Magic 无法编辑 SSML-H 扩展 <{0}>。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit the <{0}> voice-definition element.": "Magic 无法编辑 voice-definition 元素 <{0}>。",
  "text:SSML-H must use a namespaced <speak> root element.": "SSML-H 必须使用带命名空间的 <speak> 根元素。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit the <{0}> element at the document level.": "Magic 无法编辑文档级别的 <{0}> 元素。",
  "text:Magic cannot edit <{0}> blocks. Keep this document in the SSML-H editor.": "Magic 无法编辑 <{0}> 块。请继续在 SSML-H 编辑器中编辑此文档。",
